}

Where:
- $W$ is the set of workers (IDs: "1" to "12", corresponding to "Task Time Required" values in rows 1-12 of file_0_view_0)
- $T$ is the set of tasks (IDs: "A" to "J", corresponding to columns A-J of file_0_view_0)
